        "text": "The home screen helps identify what matters today. Urgent tasks, the main plan and optional activities are separated, while appointments with a fixed time appear under ‘Be on time’. A schedule with work sessions and breaks sits alongside them. Unfinished tasks stay visible so they can be deliberately rescheduled. This structure makes priorities clear and leaves room for rest instead of treating every item as equally urgent."
